  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your power over the dead extends to influence over their destiny.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Death sphere, Fate sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may use your word abilities as ghost strikes (using your Death sphere caster level to determine range and number of targets but your Fate sphere caster level for any other effects). Additionally, when you reanimate one or more targets, you may target them with a single word ability as a free action. If the undead creatures are maintained through concentration (such as through the Sustained Reanimation talent), you may concentrate on this word and the reanimation as part of the same action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/death#toc83\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
